* text=auto
*.cs text eol=lf
*.asmdef text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
# 取证脚本必须是 LF：core.autocrlf=true + `* text=auto` 会在检出时把 .sh 换成 CRLF，
# 那会让 bash 把每条命令的参数带上 \r（Unity 的 -logFile 路径首当其冲）。
*.sh text eol=lf
*.meta text eol=lf whitespace=-blank-at-eol
*.asset text eol=lf whitespace=-blank-at-eol
*.unity text eol=lf whitespace=-blank-at-eol
*.shader text eol=lf whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof,-space-before-tab
*.hlsl text eol=lf
*.cginc text eol=lf whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof,-space-before-tab
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.otf binary
*.ttf binary
